  <p>The 2025 figure of 74.1% suggests growing OA adoption, though this may partly reflect the fact that recently indexed articles in PubMed are more likely to come from PMC-participating journals. The Q1 2026 dip (53.8%) is likely an artifact of embargo delays — many articles published in early 2026 may not yet have been deposited in PMC at the time of data collection.</p>

